1
00:01:08,470 --> 00:01:12,940
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:15,960
[Episode 12]

3
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:17,440
[This door leads to the sunken plaza.]

4
00:01:18,230 --> 00:01:19,640
Your wife was taken away
by the police for questioning.

5
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,680
Is she really suspected of a crime?

6
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,710
Did you know about this?

7
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:23,430
Lin Di'er was released 24 hours later
after the interrogation.

8
00:01:23,430 --> 00:01:24,430
Do you have anything to say?

9
00:01:24,430 --> 00:01:25,560
Is she really innocent?

10
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,870
You saw the fans' comments, right?

11
00:01:26,870 --> 00:01:28,410
They want you to stay away from her.

12
00:01:28,410 --> 00:01:29,160
Recently,

13
00:01:28,930 --> 00:01:33,880
[Breaking News
in the Entertainment Industry]

14
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:31,200
Lin Di'er,
the wife of the actor Zhao Xiao,

15
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:33,000
has been suspected
of illegal business operations

16
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,640
and was taken away
by the police for investigation,

17
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,800
[The case against Zhao Xiao's wife
for illegal business operations was dropped.]

18
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,229
which has sparked heated discussions
across the Internet.

19
00:01:35,810 --> 00:01:37,020
[Public doubts have not been dispelled.]

20
00:01:36,350 --> 00:01:39,400
Yesterday, the police dropped the case
due to insufficient evidence.

21
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,350
This controversy

22
00:01:40,350 --> 00:01:43,280
has also had a spillover impact
on Zhao Xiao's image.

23
00:01:46,289 --> 00:01:47,039
Zhao Xiao!

24
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:47,870
Get in the car!

25
00:01:50,890 --> 00:01:51,710
Mr. Zhao, don't go!

26
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:52,509
Mr. Zhao Xiao!

27
00:01:53,229 --> 00:01:55,690
Please answer the questions,
Mr. Zhao Xiao!

28
00:01:55,789 --> 00:01:57,789
Mr. Zhao Xiao, please say something!

29
00:01:57,789 --> 00:01:58,600
Mr. Zhao Xiao!

30
00:01:58,650 --> 00:01:59,650
Wait!

31
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:09,310
Why are you looking for me
at this critical moment?

32
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:11,140
Aren't you afraid of being photographed

33
00:02:11,140 --> 00:02:12,600
and causing more trouble?

34
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:14,310
What's there to be afraid of?

35
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:18,160
As long as our relationship is legitimate,

36
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,579
[Agency Agreement]

37
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:19,840
they will have nothing to write about.

38
00:02:19,610 --> 00:02:20,780
[Divorce Agreement] [Agency Agreement]

39
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:26,290
Mr. Zhao,

40
00:02:26,630 --> 00:02:28,090
have you ever thought that

41
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,690
since Lin Di'er could ask the paparazzi
to make up stories

42
00:02:29,690 --> 00:02:31,130
about you just like before,

43
00:02:31,130 --> 00:02:32,530
perhaps she will

44
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:35,150
think of other ways
to deal with you in the future,

45
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:36,840
even if it's just to satisfy

46
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:38,390
her possessiveness of you?

47
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:40,590
Then why are you asking me

48
00:02:41,079 --> 00:02:42,000
to divorce her?

49
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:44,520
Is it also for possessiveness?

50
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,190
Yes.

51
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:49,630
If you let me be your agent,

52
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,090
not only can I make you popular,

53
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:55,760
but I can also give you the freedom
Lin Di'er can't give you.

54
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,310
What I want is not just freedom.

55
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:04,170
I know you want resources.

56
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:07,000
But Lin Di'er has spent 10 years
trying to boost your career,

57
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,190
and this is the furthest she can boost it.

58
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:10,770
How else can she help you?

59
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,710
You said you want to help me.

60
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:13,710
Isn't it also

61
00:03:14,630 --> 00:03:16,110
for your own reputation?

62
00:03:16,310 --> 00:03:17,120
Of course.

63
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,750
But more importantly,

64
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:23,170
you're the male lead
Mr. Pei has invested in,

65
00:03:23,590 --> 00:03:26,720
so I won't let you
get caught up in public controversies.

66
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:28,360
Xu Jing.

67
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,430
I can agree
to go to the press conference with you

68
00:03:31,430 --> 00:03:33,150
because this is exactly what I want.

69
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:35,190
But a contract is far from enough.

70
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,590
Lin Di'er has supported me until today.

71
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:39,630
She at least deserves some credit
for her hard work.

72
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:41,090
If you want to replace her,

73
00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:42,860
you must offer more.

74
00:03:46,340 --> 00:03:48,540
[Divorce Agreement] [Agency Agreement]

75
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:56,890
It is a pleasure working with you.

76
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,870
It is a pleasure working with you.

77
00:03:59,870 --> 00:04:01,390
[Divorce Agreement]

78
00:04:04,150 --> 00:04:05,080
No way!

79
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,590
If you want to divorce me,

80
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:11,030
you'd better get your money ready
to fight me in court.

81
00:04:12,100 --> 00:04:12,870
Zhao Xiao.

82
00:04:13,910 --> 00:04:14,960
You know exactly

83
00:04:15,610 --> 00:04:17,070
how much money I've spent on you

84
00:04:17,070 --> 00:04:18,470
over these years, right?

85
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:22,000
Do you think
having acted in a few short dramas

86
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,580
is enough to pay it back?

87
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,720
Dear.

88
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:27,190
I just don't want your efforts

89
00:04:27,190 --> 00:04:28,210
to be wasted,

90
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:30,180
so I've suggested a divorce.

91
00:04:30,180 --> 00:04:32,680
This is just a temporary measure.

92
00:04:32,950 --> 00:04:34,360
Can you understand?

93
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:38,990
This is also
what Xu Jing has taught you, right?

94
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:41,040
Why are you bringing up Xu Jing?

95
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,580
Then just tell me honestly today,

96
00:04:43,740 --> 00:04:45,480
whether there's anything going on

97
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,800
between you and her.

98
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,680
If you don't turst me,

99
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,090
then I have nothing more to say.

100
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,560
There's something wrong with Xu Jing.

101
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:02,340
She had an ulterior motive
from the moment she approached you.

102
00:05:02,340 --> 00:05:03,800
She wants to drive a wedge between us.

103
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,060
What's happening today
is exactly what she wants.

104
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:06,120
Can't you sense that?

105
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:08,720
Xu Jing is just someone
who puts profits first.

106
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:11,210
She's doing these things just to ensure
that her own projects can succeed.

107
00:05:11,210 --> 00:05:13,210
She and I are the same kind of people.

108
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,780
And to this day,

109
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,530
she has never done anything

110
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:20,820
that would damage my reputation, right?

111
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:22,880
You don't need to make insinuations.

112
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:25,440
You and she are the same kind of people.

113
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,720
What about me?

114
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,690
What kind of person am I?

115
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:40,430
Zhao Xiao.

116
00:05:41,950 --> 00:05:43,750
We've been together for so long.

117
00:05:45,159 --> 00:05:46,420
Have you ever loved me?

118
00:05:52,190 --> 00:05:54,320
I've given you everything you wanted.

119
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,730
I want a little bit of your love.

120
00:05:57,070 --> 00:05:58,630
Why won't you give it to me?

121
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:04,900
Di'er.

122
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,510
Why don't you go abroad
to lay low for a while?

123
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:09,040
Just do it for our daughter.

124
00:06:09,150 --> 00:06:10,430
Wait until things blow over,

125
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:12,230
and then you can come back, okay?

126
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:23,990
[Name: Lin Di'er]

127
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,000
Ms. Lin Di'er and I

128
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:44,380
agreed to divorce half a year ago.

129
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:47,940
[Mr. Zhao Xiao's Divorce Press Conference]

130
00:06:44,830 --> 00:06:46,360
But we have a child,

131
00:06:46,750 --> 00:06:48,480
so we didn't make it public.

132
00:06:49,070 --> 00:06:49,680
Now,

133
00:06:50,030 --> 00:06:52,030
the suspicion against Ms. Lin Di'er

134
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:54,480
has been cleared
due to insufficient evidence.

135
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,800
She has decided to leave here

136
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:58,060
and go abroad alone for further studies,

137
00:06:58,159 --> 00:07:00,680
getting ready
to start a new chapter in her life.

138
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:03,280
But I am also deeply concerned
about our child.

139
00:07:04,070 --> 00:07:05,580
I will fulfill my responsibilities
as a father

140
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:07,650
and won't let her
suffer the slightest harm.

141
00:07:07,650 --> 00:07:15,150
[Mr. Zhao Xiao's Divorce Press Conference]

142
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:09,950
So I implore all my media friends

143
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:10,870
to go easy on us

144
00:07:11,510 --> 00:07:13,570
and not to disturb the child's growth

145
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,510
so that she can have a happy childhood.

146
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:18,480
This is my greatest wish as a father.

147
00:07:19,310 --> 00:07:20,270
Thank you all.

148
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,750
Sir.

149
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:27,680
Madam's things are almost packed.

150
00:07:29,950 --> 00:07:31,240
I'll give you an address later.

151
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,500
Send the things there.

152
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,620
Just put the rest in the storage room.

153
00:07:35,950 --> 00:07:37,310
Di'er went abroad for further studies.

154
00:07:37,310 --> 00:07:38,790
She probably won't be back
for a long time.

155
00:07:38,790 --> 00:07:39,510
Okay.

156
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:42,440
Then I'll clean up the study room
on the second floor.

157
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:43,120
No need.

158
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,159
I'll clean up the upstairs myself.

159
00:07:45,159 --> 00:07:46,120
Okay, sir.

160
00:07:55,330 --> 00:07:56,920
[Agency Agreement]

161
00:08:18,250 --> 00:08:19,390
[To Ms. Lin Di'er]

162
00:08:26,990 --> 00:08:29,740
[Personal information of Xu Jing]

163
00:08:34,470 --> 00:08:36,789
[Personal information of Xu Jing]

164
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:39,570
[Personal Information of Song A'lan]

165
00:08:44,370 --> 00:08:45,090
[Personal Information of Song A'lan]

166
00:08:45,090 --> 00:08:46,640
[Fourthly, Romantic History—
She was once in love with Zhao Xiao.]

167
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:48,340
[They loved each other deeply,
and she fully supported his acting career.]

168
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,720
What about my face?

169
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,970
I don't want anything else.

170
00:08:58,870 --> 00:09:01,060
I only want your skin.

171
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:03,070
Xiao.

172
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:10,240
Maybe I am your enemy.

173
00:09:14,790 --> 00:09:15,960
Why could Xu Jing get

174
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,630
Du Chunqing's support
right from the start?

175
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:18,750
Why did she reject everyone else

176
00:09:18,750 --> 00:09:20,000
and only want you to be her male lead?

177
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,240
She also opposes me in every aspect

178
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,910
and wants to drive a wedge between us.

179
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:25,770
Have you ever thought about that?

180
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:28,400
I don't care who is behind Xu Jing.

181
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:29,150
Nor do I care

182
00:09:29,150 --> 00:09:31,290
whether she intentionally
approached me from the start.

183
00:09:31,290 --> 00:09:32,480
All I know is that

184
00:09:32,870 --> 00:09:35,200
I, Zhao Xiao,
have to do my best to climb up.

185
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,870
Xu Jing's resources
are right in front of me.

186
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:38,270
I have no reason not to use them.

187
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:39,000
Lin Di'er.

188
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:41,480
We've been married for so many years.

189
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,320
Do you think

190
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:43,480
I have to live under your surveillance

191
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,410
and control for the rest of my life?

192
00:09:45,830 --> 00:09:46,860
Let me tell you.

193
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,600
Xu Jing wants me to be the male lead

194
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,150
because she saw my value.

195
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:51,210
But what about you?

196
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,990
You will only destroy me!

197
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,440
How could you think this way?

198
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:57,530
I was trying to protect you.

199
00:09:57,670 --> 00:09:59,280
That's why I went to the media.

200
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:00,210
Also,

201
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:02,420
I've never really wanted to hurt you.

202
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:03,440
Trust me.

203
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:05,960
Stop making excuses.

204
00:10:07,550 --> 00:10:09,610
For the sake of our years of marriage,

205
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:11,360
could you please let me go?

206
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,460
You see?

207
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,960
Ever since she appeared,

208
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,570
you've never trusted me again.

209
00:10:20,150 --> 00:10:20,790
Zhao Xiao.

210
00:10:22,030 --> 00:10:24,090
Xu Jing is here to take revenge on you.

211
00:10:24,300 --> 00:10:26,090
I can see from her eyes

212
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,780
that she hates you.

213
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,240
Just go.

214
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:41,410
I actually want to introduce A'lan to you.

215
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:44,410
She's my ex-wife.

216
00:10:44,430 --> 00:10:46,090
Maybe she really wants to know

217
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:50,320
who turned our lives into a script.

218
00:10:52,690 --> 00:10:54,520
[A'lan]

219
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,120
Is that you, Xiao?

220
00:10:57,720 --> 00:11:00,430
Xiao, you've finally remembered me.

221
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,360
Hello?

222
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,360
A'lan, it's me.

223
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,240
I know that

224
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,730
I still owe you an explanation.

225
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:25,730
But I'm actually a victim, too.

226
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:29,120
I have a lot to tell you.

227
00:11:29,510 --> 00:11:30,440
Are you free?

228
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:33,870
Let's meet.
